ent-GlovePrintScanner = microfiber scanner
    .desc = A portable scanner that collects surface microfibers or an individual sample from gloves, clothing or equipment and dispenses a sample swab. Select its mode in the held item's menu or by using it in hand.
ent-GlovePrintSwab = microfiber sample swab
    .desc = A physical carrier for a microfiber sample. Insert a collected sample into a microfiber analyzer.
ent-BoxGlovePrintSwabs = microfiber sample swab box
    .desc = A box containing ten empty microfiber sample swabs.
ent-GlovePrintAnalyzer = microfiber analyzer
    .desc = A machine that identifies gloves, clothing and equipment in a microfiber sample. Shows item pictures and individual sample codes.
ent-GlovePrintAnalyzerFlatpack = microfiber analyzer flatpack
    .desc = A flatpack for constructing a microfiber analyzer. Use a multitool to deploy it.
ent-GlovePrintReportPaper = microfiber analysis report
    .desc = An official NanoTrasen Security form containing a report generated automatically by a microfiber analyzer.
